    "foxify-1713238407fEc8v": {
      "f-heading-1713253263AiIDr-text_html": "Digital Gifts for all Occasion",
      "f-richtext-1713253263JZ3hT-text_html": "<p>If you're unsure of her preferences, let her choose her gift with our convenient gift cards. Pair it with a heartfelt message to make her feel truly special.</p>",
      "f-richtext-17132549983PkP3-text_html": "<p>hong kong only</p>",
      "f-heading-1713254998OaOPW-text_html": "permanent jewelry",
      "f-richtext-1713254998hc6Fw-text_html": "<p>Our Permanent jewelry is tailored to fit seamlessly, designed for continuous wear. We provide 14K solid gold chains in diverse styles suitable for everyday use. Personalize your jewelry with our extensive selection of charms and mix and match with our bracelets for a unique touch.</p>",
      "f-button-1713254998U9F3M-button_label_html": "learn more",
      "f-heading-17132554187PeAk-text_html": "faq",
      "f-collapsible-tab-1713255418VLgnf-heading_html": "What does a diamond symbolize?",
      "f-collapsible-tab-1713255418VLgnf-content_html": "A diamond is more than just a gift to be worn, cherished, and loved at the time of giving – it can be passed down to generations as a meaningful heirloom for your loved ones and become the start of a new family tradition.",
      "f-collapsible-tab-1713255418sZWWu-heading_html": "Can I personalize jewelry for Mother's Day?",
      "f-collapsible-tab-1713255418sZWWu-content_html": "Yes, many of our jewelry pieces can be customized or personalized to add an extra personal touch. From engraving initials to selecting specific diamond colors and cuts, you could find a one-of-a-kind piece that will make your Mother's Day gift even more special.",
      "f-collapsible-tab-1713255418jO51K-heading_html": "Do you offer gift cards?",
      "f-collapsible-tab-1713255418jO51K-content_html": "Yes! We offer gift cards in preset denominations of  USD $250, USD $500, USD $1,000, or you can choose a custom value. Please note that our gift cards are non-refundable. We currently offer gift cards for customers located in the United States only.",
      "f-collapsible-tab-17132555329BSmx-heading_html": "Is my order shipped immediately upon payment?",
      "f-collapsible-tab-17132555329BSmx-content_html": "We encourage our community of creatives and designers not to overproduce and operate on a made-to-order basis. However, we also understand your urge for last-minute shopping. Here, we have curated a list of designs that are ready to ship.",
      "f-heading-1713257826Wvo7X-text_html": "mother's day",
      "f-heading-1713257832eRThp-text_html": "JEWELRY GIFT GUIDE",
      "f-richtext-1713257835Ghd2U-text_html": "When it comes to honoring the mothers in your life, nothing expresses your love and appreciation quite like the gift of gemstones. From sparkling diamonds to elegant precious metals to intricate designs, each piece is mindfully crafted to be the classic of the future. Here are a few recommendations from The Future Rocks' team.",
      "f-richtext-1713257842N2egm-text_html": "Photo by <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@bencehalmosi?utm_content=creditCopyText&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=unsplash\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bence Halmosi</a> on <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Unsplash</a>",
      "f-heading-1713263963r9Ul5-text_html": "Ready-to-ship",
      "f-richtext-1713263963XeLjd-text_html": "While we encourage most of our creatives and designers to operate on a made-to-order basis, we also understand your urge for last-minute shopping. Here, we have curated a list of designs that are ready-to-ship. However, to avoid overproduction, some metal options, diamond carats, sizes, etc., are only available upon request. Test your luck and browse through our selection below.",
      "f-heading-1713265238YF1q8-text_html": "shop by price",
