      "f-heading-1721892662Ze3BQ-text_html": "FIFTY. nine.",
      "f-richtext-1721892662ByCFX-text_html": "Each Blondie creation summons 59 hours of meticulous craftsmanship. We painstakingly cut and polish a 60-carat lab-grown sapphire into a 9-carat band, then perfect every facet and angle to ensure maximum shine and light reflection, achieving the pinnacle of symmetry and smoothness.",
      "f-heading-1721892676rvtsj-text_html": "Gold. redux.",
      "f-richtext-17218926760ey3R-text_html": "A lustrous 18K gold inlay fortifies Blondie's radiant lab-grown sapphire ring band, accentuating the warm, yellow glow of the sapphire halo. The inlay design adds a distinctive touch, emitting a unique golden hue rarely seen in conventional gold rings.",
      "f-heading-172189267624LZO-text_html": "solo. stacked.",
      "f-richtext-1721892676AVGrO-text_html": "With its bold color and daring design, Blondie is a testament to your unique personality. Blondie takes on a new dimension when stacked with its classic siblings, creating a layered, eclectic look that exudes next-level sophistication."
